    <p class="section-sub">You are doing great work for your current clients. But while you are heads-down on projects, new leads are filling out your contact form and hearing nothing back for days. By then, they have already called your competitor.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box fade-in">
      <ul>
        <li>New leads submit a form and get no response for 24-48 hours — by then they have moved on</li>
        <li>You send one follow-up email and then forget about the lead entirely</li>
        <li>Past customers never hear from you again, so they forget you exist when they need your services</li>
        <li>You know you should be sending newsletters but never have time to write them</li>
        <li>Your "marketing strategy" is hoping that word of mouth keeps working</li>
