    <p class="section-sub">We build marketing automation systems that respond to leads in seconds, nurture them over weeks, and convert them into customers — all without you touching a keyboard.</p>
    <div class="solution-copy fade-in">
      <p>Here is how it works: A potential customer fills out a form on your website. Within 60 seconds, they get a personalized welcome email and a text message confirming you received their inquiry. Two days later, a follow-up email arrives with helpful information related to their specific need. Four days after that, another touchpoint. Then a week later. Then a gentle nudge two weeks out.</p>
      <p>Each message is written in your voice, addresses their specific situation, and provides genuine value. It does not feel automated. It feels like a business that cares enough to follow up.</p>
      <p>Meanwhile, past customers receive periodic check-ins, seasonal promotions, and referral requests — keeping your business top of mind for repeat business and word-of-mouth. All of this runs automatically, 24/7, 365 days a year.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

